{"id":"82d5af5d15","t":"The Pearl of Albrecht","c":"cv","n":28,"l":28,"s":["ml","az"],"k":{"ml":"the-pearl-of-albrecht","az":"the-pearl-of-albrecht"},"u":1795642848187,"desc":"بعد وفاة آلا، تُترك لويز مفلسة، لا تملك سوى اللؤلؤة الغامضة. ولأنها تجهل استحالة امتلاك إرث إمبراطوري ثمين، تحاول لويز رهنها لتغطية نفقات دفن آلا. لكن ولي العهد كايوس، الذي كان متنكرًا في زي مارغريف بورغ منذ اعترافه بالخيانة على يد والدة لويز، يتلاعب بها، ويجعلها تدفع ثمن ذنوب والدتها الراحلة. وسط مكائد الإغواء والسياسة والانتقام، تجد لويز نفسها مجرد بيدق في لعبة، مُجبرة على اتخاذ قرار بشأن ما إذا كانت ستثق بكايوس – ليس فقط بقلبها، بل أيضًا بلؤلؤة ألبريشت.","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["رومانسى","شوجو","مانهوا"],"src":{"ml":"the-pearl-of-albrecht","az":"the-pearl-of-albrecht"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-pearl-of-albrecht|/manga/the-pearl-of-albrecht/1/","az":"the-pearl-of-albrecht|/series/the-pearl-of-albrecht/chapter-1"},"2":{"ml":"the-pearl-of-albrecht|/manga/the-pearl-of-albrecht/2/","az":"the-pearl-of-albrecht|/series/the-pearl-of-albrecht/chapter-2"},"3":{"ml":"the-pearl-of-albrecht|/manga/the-pearl-of-albrecht/3/","az":"the-pearl-of-albrecht|/series/the-pearl-of-albrecht/chapter-3"},"4":{"ml":"the-pearl-of-albrecht|/manga/the-pearl-of-albrecht/4/","az":"the-pearl-of-albrecht|/series/the-pearl-of-albrecht/chapter-4"},"5":{"ml":"the-pearl-of-albrecht|/manga/the-pearl-of-albrecht/5/","az":"the-pearl-of-albrecht|/series/the-pearl-of-albrecht/chapter-5"},"6":{"ml":"the-pearl-of-albrecht|/manga/the-pearl-of-albrecht/6/","az":"the-pearl-of-albrecht|/series/the-pearl-of-albrecht/chapter-6"},"7":{"ml":"the-pearl-of-albrecht|/manga/the-pearl-of-albrecht/7/","az":"the-pearl-of-albrecht|/series/the-pearl-of-albrecht/chapter-7"},"8":{"ml":"the-pearl-of-albrecht|/manga/the-pearl-of-albrecht/8/","az":"the-pearl-of-albrecht|/series/the-pearl-of-albrecht/chapter-8"},"9":{"ml":"the-pearl-of-albrecht|/manga/the-pearl-of-albrecht/9/","az":"the-pearl-of-albrecht|/series/the-pearl-of-albrecht/chapte